OL,3,ABank of America hit with $1.2bn fine
OL,4,Afor money laundering failings
OL,5,
OL,6,FBank of America has been fined $1.2bn
OL,7,F(#910m) for failing to detect potential
OL,8,Fmoney laundering and other illegal
OL,9,Factivity, the US Treasury Department
OL,10,Fsaid on Tuesday.
OL,12,FThe banking giant failed to report over
OL,13,F$5bn in suspicious activity to the
OL,14,Fgovernment, $1bn of which posed
OL,15,Fnational security and illicit finance
OL,16,Frisks, the Treasury said.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,110,105,200,300,0,100
