OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%,.** %-,(,%,. (,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ABank of America hit with $1.2bn fine
OL,4,Afor money laundering failings
OL,5,
OL,6,FThose failures included not flagging
OL,7,Ftransactions that possibly involved
OL,8,FChinese money laundering networks or
OL,9,Ftrade-based laundering "with a
OL,10,Fsubstantial nexus to the southwest
OL,11,Fborder", according to the Treasury.
OL,13,F"Our team is far along with and
OL,14,Fcommitted to completing the work
OL,15,Frequired to address the issues raised
OL,16,Fby our regulators," Bank of America
OL,17,Ftold the BBC.
